Loop currents in AV3 Sb5 kagome metals: multipolar and toroidal magnetic orders
Morten H. Christensen,1, ∗ Turan Birol,2 Brian M. Andersen,1 and Rafael M. Fernandes3

arXiv:2207.12820v2 [cond-mat.str-el] 14 Oct 2022

